[00:03.19]STRUCTURE:
[00:06.66]बंद आँखों से प्रत्यक्ष, बंद कानों से आराधना
[00:10.13]ढहते स्तंभ के नीचे खड़ी सहीर की प्रतिष्ठापना
[00:13.60]Eyes closed, seeing light / Ears shut, prayer is right
[00:17.07]Falling pillars, I stand still / Sahair — that's the real deal
[00:20.54]Proofs on proofs, but I see direct
[00:24.01]Closed my eyes — no defect
[00:27.48]Temple falling? I don't check
[00:30.95]Kabir in my left, Snoop on the deck
[00:34.42]बंद आँखें... बंद आँखें... yeah...
